thought. "I am King Trog!" The caveman pounded his

13
00:00:40.923 --> 00:00:43.338
chest. Mayor Bloom came out of the

14
00:00:43.339 --> 00:00:46.289
building. "Go away! You're scaring

15
00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:48.607
everyone!" King Trog glared at the

16
00:00:48.608 --> 00:00:51.533
mayor. "Are you the king

17
00:00:51.534 --> 00:00:54.212
here?" "I'm not a king," the mayor

18
00:00:54.213 --> 00:00:56.580
said. "But I am in charge

19
00:00:56.581 --> 00:00:59.348
here." King Trog looked at the City Hall

20
00:00:59.349 --> 00:01:01.360
building. Then he looked back at the

21
00:01:01.361 --> 00:01:06.072
mayor. "I rule this kingdom now. Go back in your

22
00:01:06.073 --> 00:01:09.002
cave!" King Trog swung his

23
00:01:09.003 --> 00:01:13.052
club. "Ahh!" Mayor Bloom ran back into the

24
00:01:13.053 --> 00:01:15.612
building. King Trog pounded his chest

25
00:01:15.613 --> 00:01:19.537
again. "I'm the king of

26
00:01:19.538 --> 00:01:23.332
everything!" "You're not my king!" a woman

27
00:01:23.333 --> 00:01:25.607
shouted. "Yeah!" a man

28
00:01:25.608 --> 00:01:29.862
yelled. "I didn't vote for you! I voted for Mayor

29
00:01:29.863 --> 00:01:34.357
Bloom!" "Grarg!" King Trog grew furious.

30
00:01:34.358 --> 00:01:40.065
He jumped off the steps, swung his club, and smashed a car.

31
00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:45.209
"Hey!" a man said. "I just bought that car!"

32
00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:49.150
"Grarg!" King Trog swung his club again.

33
00:01:49.151 --> 00:01:52.451
"Ahh!" The man ran away.

34
00:01:52.452 --> 00:01:55.479
Roxy landed in front of the caveman.

35
00:01:55.480 --> 00:01:57.269
"That's enough, Trog!

36
00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:59.108
You're not the king here!

37
00:01:59.109 --> 00:02:00.993
Stop scaring people!"

38
00:02:00.994 --> 00:02:05.677
"Grarg!" King Trog swung his club at Roxy.

39
00:02:05.678 --> 00:02:07.673
She blocked it with her arm.

40
00:02:07.674 --> 00:02:09.970
King Trog's mouth hung open.

41
00:02:09.971 --> 00:02:13.759
"You have strong powers."

42
00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:17.074
"Yes, I do," Roxy said.

43
00:02:17.075 --> 00:02:19.518
King Trog charged toward Roxy.

44
00:02:19.519 --> 00:02:21.668
His club swung wildly.

45
00:02:21.669 --> 00:02:24.021
Roxy fired her eye laser beams.

46
00:02:24.022 --> 00:02:29.824
Whiz-hoo! King Trog's club exploded.

47
00:02:29.825 --> 00:02:31.878
The caveman stomped his foot.

48
00:02:31.879 --> 00:02:34.646
"How dare you destroy my club!

49
00:02:34.647 --> 00:02:40.444
I'm the king! Everyone must bow down to me!"

50
00:02:40.445 --> 00:02:42.905
"Yes!" someone shouted.

51
00:02:42.906 --> 00:02:45.207
"Bow down to my master!"

52
00:02:45.208 --> 00:02:49.178
Roxy looked over. "Professor Beard!"

53
00:02:49.179 --> 00:02:52.151
Just then King Trog grabbed her.

54
00:02:52.152 --> 00:02:55.948
"Grr!" Roxy tried to wriggle free.

55
00:02:55.949 --> 00:02:58.833
But the caveman was too strong.

56
00:02:58.834 --> 00:03:01.802
"Good job, Master!" Professor Beard said.

57
00:03:01.803 --> 00:03:03.537
"You really are powerful!

58
00:03:03.538 --> 00:03:05.739
Will you still share your treasure with me?"

59
00:03:05.740 --> 00:03:08.328
King Trog ignored the professor.

60
00:03:08.329 --> 00:03:11.734
The caveman pulled a metal band from his pouch.

61
00:03:11.735 --> 00:03:13.959
He placed it on Roxy's head.

62
00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:16.322
Roxy began to feel weak.

63
00:03:16.323 --> 00:03:24.773
King Trog smiled. "Powers, come to me!"

